# Claude Code Agent 병렬 worktree 디렉토리 (cherry-pick + cleanup 후 잔존 file 무시).
# Git 측 bookkeeping 은 `git worktree remove` 로 정리되지만 file system 잔존 가능.
.claude/worktrees/

